      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tighter leading-[1.05] mb-6">
        AI in Dental Patient Engagement: <span class="text-teal-600">What Actually Works in 2025</span>
      </h1>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-12 p-4 bg-cream-100 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200">
